--- a/letsdo-original/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/unique-food-A/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -1,3 +1,10 @@
+## Private NeoForge 1.21.1 retirement.3
+- Kettle brewing retains every consumed ingredient, including its exact container, in EMI material planning and shows that same container in the bottle slot.
+- Restore only Meadow's unique in-world fondue guidance: one cheese wheel yields four stored portions, one cheese piece yields one, and one bread plus one stored portion yields one cheese stick. Heat, stirring, capacity and dipping restrictions match Meadow 1.4.10.
+- Fondue guidance is client-side and excluded from recipe trees because stored portions are not inventory items. The pot is a reusable catalyst, not a consumed container. Obsolete fondue serializers and fractional-fill data are not bundled.
+- Retain Beachparty, HerbalBrews, Bakery cake cutting and grape-pot guidance (three grapes plus one Vinery Wine Bottle per juice). Native duplicate adapters remain excluded at compile time; their unchanged upstream sources are retained to keep the private patch small.
+- Cake-cutting data still requires this compatibility jar on the server as well as the client. Fondue and grape-pot guidance require no additional server data.
+
 ## [Let's Do Addon] Emi Compat 2.0.3
 - Barrel Fermentation recipes now show the required Grapejuice in the barrel's juice slot, instead of only naming it in the fluid bar tooltip
 - Grapejuice items now list their Barrel Fermentation recipes under "Uses"
